  "text": "## Key Principles  \n| Principle | What It Means |\n|---|---|\n| **Lawfulness** | Data processing must be legal and justified |\n| **Fairness** | Must be transparent with customers |\n| **Purpose Limitation** | Only use data for stated purpose |\n| **Data Minimization** | Only collect what's needed |\n| **Accuracy** | Keep data current and correct |\n| **Storage Limitation** | Only keep data as long as necessary |\n| **Integrity & Confidentiality** | Protect data with security |\n| **Accountability** | Document what you do with data |",
